#: thold.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span class=\"deviceUp\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br><br>Math Operators: <span class=\"deviceUp\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span class=\"deviceUp\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span class=\"deviceUp\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span class=\"deviceUp\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "RPN izteiksme ir ar RRDtool saderīga RPN izteiksme. Sintakse ietver visas zemāk norādītās funkcijas, kā arī ierīces un datu vaicājuma aizstāšanas izteiksmes, piemēram, <span class=\"deviceUp\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>. Lai RPN izteiksmē izmantotu datu avotu, jālieto sintakse: <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:dsname|</span>. Piemēram, <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> iegūs datu avota traffic_in pašreizējo vērtību no RRD datnes(-ēm), kas saistīta(-as) ar grafiku. Var iekļaut jebkuru grafika datu avotu.<br><br>Matemātiskie operatori: <span class=\"deviceUp\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Funkcijas: <span class=\"deviceUp\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Plūsmas operatori: <span class=\"deviceUp\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Salīdzināšanas funkcijas: <span class=\"deviceUp\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

